Summary:
Cruz had a string of extramarital affairs and was photographed with women who are now suing him for defamation. The senator is trying to have his career ruined by a tabloid for publishing stories about him.
What happened: In a statement released via Facebook on Friday, Cruz said:
"I had no knowledge about any of the reports concerning Ted Cruz and my relationship with these women, which were in the hands of American Media Inc, and I have not, as yet, read them. I have been a champion of the National Constitution Center and as an Independent for the past four years, the Senate Majority Leader, and I will do everything I can to support the efforts of that organization and its leadership.”
